OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after woman taken to
OL,4,Ahospital following dog attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested following a dog
OL,7,Fattack in Aberdeen.
OL,9,FPolice Scotland were called to reports
OL,10,Fof a woman and a dog being bitten by
OL,11,Fanother dog in Donald Dewar Court at
OL,12,Fabout 15:25.
OL,14,FA force spokesperson said the woman was
OL,15,Ftaken to hospital for treatment and the
OL,16,Fdog was taken to the vet.
OL,18,FThe man has been charged in connection
OL,19,Fwith the Dangerous Dogs Act 1991.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
